    "Diagnostic": "False \"not ready\" alerts traced to two separate causes: 1. the risk-alert size matching was reading a manual-entry-only RTW size field that's almost always blank, instead of the formula field that falls back to the customer's self-reported Acuity size. 2. The future-appointments scan feeding the alert panel wasn't filtering by appointment type at all, so fittings/pickups/alterations appointments could also trigger a \"not ready\" alert meant only for upcoming Consultations.",
