    "Diagnostic": "Pipeline's Kanban had no way for staff to know, without asking, exactly what each lane means (Waitlist, Pre-Appointment, Deliberating, Sold, Order Ready, In Alterations, In Fulfillment). Until now, no single document compiled the business logic of the 7 phases to write them accurately (docs/phase_logic_rulebook.md was created in parallel to this work).",
