    "Full Description": "Change the \"Missing Data\" language to \"Must Assign\" for Room and Alterations Lead. Reception should be able to check clients in regardless of missing data, so they can post to the #client-appointment-arrivals Slack channel. Logged as: Suggestion - Daily Ops > Appointments. NOTE: closely related to existing tracker item #32 (Appointments page Missing Data flags too noisy) - may be the same underlying ask.",
